      "label": "We may also disclose your information to partners for joint marketi…",
      "cmsId": "privacy-policy-083",
      "html": "We may also disclose your information to partners for joint marketing initiatives and other collaborations. Additionally, we may disclose your information to authorities to comply with laws and regulations."
